Scroll down to the bottom of the page to the \"Preferences\" section.\nL31: \nL32: 【14†Image: New_parent_preferences.jpeg】\nL33: Here you will see options to show or hide the “Videos” and “Create” tabs of the app’s Library, along with an option to hide the “Home” icon in the app’s Learning Path to deter children from exiting a lesson before it’s completed.\nL34: \nL35: You will also see an option to show or hide a seasonal theme, such as Halloween.\nL36: \nL37: Was this article helpful?\nL38: \nL39: [Button: Yes] [Button: No]\nL40: \nL41: 5 out of 6 found this helpful\nL42: \nL43: Have more questions? 【1†Submit a request】\nL44: \nL45: 【15†Return to top】\nL46: ## Comments\nL47: \nL48: 0 comments\nL49: \nL50: Article is closed for comments.\nL51: \nL52: 【16†Khan Academy】\nL53: \nL54: 【17†Powered by Zendesk†www.zendesk.com】\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://khankids.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/21720697289243)\nciteturn734view1 --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://khankids.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/14107029578267)\nciteturn734view2 "
